  "_refreshableStates": {
    "_comment": "Only these states may be SENT to Quantum, because the ready adapters here reproduce the code system that state's return actually uses. Everything else is downloaded and parsed into state/snapshots for review, and left alone in Quantum - an SST-only refresh of Oklahoma would replace its COPO codes with FIPS codes and break the return. Add a state here when its adapter lands. TX, AZ and WA have parsers but need one verified run from the US server before they are added here.",
    "states": [
      "AL"
    ]
